 a deal of his own - he need’s his dad’s car for a date with Natsuki.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-05-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2DV5iopftsebx1xMID7W40etHgA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2DV5iopftsebx1xMID7W40etHgA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"872953","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The match between the SpeedStars and the RedSuns is set to begin. Just as Iketani makes the desperate decision to put Kenji up against Keisuke, the Eight-Six appears - with Takumi behind the wheel.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-05-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2oWhj6uYdDIz133yHwYsFyrxIHF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2oWhj6uYdDIz133yHwYsFyrxIHF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"872939","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Takumi stuns everyone with his skills in the Eight-Six, Iketani and Itsuki start plotting a way to get the new hotshot to join the SpeedStars.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-05-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Alkgr6RlI4MkGHyPHuUR29MoxEd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Alkgr6RlI4MkGHyPHuUR29MoxEd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"872954","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Driving his new Three-Two, Takeshi goes head-to-head against Ryosuke on Mt. Akina. Meanwhile, Takumi offers Iketani a first-hand look at the thrill of riding in the Eight-Six.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-05-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.1,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pzn0M0pTutBbD0WJSosSp2Jx3UH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pzn0M0pTutBbD0WJSosSp2Jx3UH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"872955","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeshi is ready to take on the Eight-Six and he has every reason to believe that the car’s driver is game. When Takumi catches wind of the situation, he’s got to decide if the challenge is worth accepting.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-06-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mSCaieZM7NLafoBsY8AK12bfdZY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mSCaieZM7NLafoBsY8AK12bfdZY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"872956","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"There’s a crowd waiting for a race to start on Mt. Akina, but the Eight-Six is nowhere to be seen. Itsuki’s in a tough spot - and Takumi’s the only one who can get him out of it.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-06-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/urPjrVaBSB6v3OkVIy6oh85caRC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/urPjrVaBSB6v3OkVIy6oh85caRC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"872940","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The race is underway with Takumi behind the wheel of the Eight-Six. His competition, Takeshi, drives the Three-Two with undeniable skill - but he can’t seem to pull away from Takumi!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-06-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o6ppj2rshJmadfxzsvtK0GabwUv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o6ppj2rshJmadfxzsvtK0GabwUv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"872941","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeshi and Takumi speed toward the finish line! Victory is at hand for the driver who can conquer the final challenges of the course - five treacherous hairpin curves.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-07-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wxJVgAEEipnFwPytKKiMvxelMnp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wxJVgAEEipnFwPytKKiMvxelMnp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"872957","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Iketani’s putting his S-13 to the test now that it’s out of the shop, but a simple practice session turns into a dangerous situation when a reckless member of the NightKids - Shingo - arrives in a red EG-6.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-07-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.1,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gHYpsjRnZUI8bPlRJZ2Z6lA21CJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gHYpsjRnZUI8bPlRJZ2Z6lA21CJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"872942","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Shingo arrives with the NightKids and he’s calling Takumi and the gang out. His demands: A Duct Tape Death Match against the Eight-Six.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-08-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/LZ0hjLtmxJf0VAmW2U9fXi8JYj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/LZ0hjLtmxJf0VAmW2U9fXi8JYj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"872958","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Shingo’s itching to take on the Eight-Six in a dangerous race, but with nobody stepping up to accept the challenge, he takes drastic measures to get his way.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-08-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bIQIqFUnQqSrZDB4R8xmMRGxNgF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bIQIqFUnQqSrZDB4R8xmMRGxNgF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"872933","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi’s had enough of Shingo’s intimidation tactics. He agrees to take on the pushy NightKid in the most treacherous of races: A Duct Tape Death Match.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-08-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6dA9AEfLgF9K9OEZQ4eR7c0kjDc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6dA9AEfLgF9K9OEZQ4eR7c0kjDc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"872934","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi and Iketani are having very different days: Takumi’s hand is taped to the Eight-Six’s steering wheel as Shingo bumps into him at high speeds. Iketani’s hanging out with a pretty girl.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-08-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vjtZTtZdF83wMjL6kmDDzHvWJkr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vjtZTtZdF83wMjL6kmDDzHvWJkr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"872935","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Iketani takes Mako out for a good time, his friends decide to tail the duo and figure out what she’s all about. They soon discover her greatest talent: outdriving them all on Mt. Usui!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-08-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/thiiRbb4tMmMpt7gACWJz91R5o9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/thiiRbb4tMmMpt7gACWJz91R5o9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"872936","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi’s upcoming race at Usui is creating friction among his friends. One reason for the tension: he’s never driven the course. A bigger reason: his opponent is Mako.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-09-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y0SORhC8kwHKGhwVpRItXlSfKa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y0SORhC8kwHKGhwVpRItXlSfKa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"872943","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mako and Sayuki are having their way with Takumi and the Eight-Six on Mt. Usui. As Takumi himself questions his ability to pull out a win, the racers approach the course’s toughest curve.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-09-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jZZs4UFZhajthdhEnh7gNxUhhyt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jZZs4UFZhajthdhEnh7gNxUhhyt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"872944","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The finish line is in sight on Mt. Usui! Mako and Sayuki know the course like the back of their hands; Takumi might need a miracle if he is to claim victory against the girls.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-09-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5Z4f6hnJt30Dky4RnY6xYPgh6q8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5Z4f6hnJt30Dky4RnY6xYPgh6q8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"872945","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When the gang heads out to a water park, Iketani sees signs that it could actually work out with Mako - until he finds photographic proof that her heart might belong to another guy.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-10-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gTpPdj23d7akj90u2lRRcrzdehB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gTpPdj23d7akj90u2lRRcrzdehB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"872946","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi’s growing rep has attracted the attention of Ryosuke, who’s ready to face the Eight-Six on Mt. Akina. Takumi better get his head on straight - this will be his greatest challenge yet.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-10-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.1,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q136hrtkrWsxYUdnScWRnZ1rJ5e.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q136hrtkrWsxYUdnScWRnZ1rJ5e.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"872947","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"At Itsuki’s behest, Takumi heads out to watch an uphill race between two of his former foes - Takeshi of the NightKids and the RedSuns’ Keisuke.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-10-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/arWbs85HQS1gSdIogd7x7dnJd3V.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/arWbs85HQS1gSdIogd7x7dnJd3V.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"872948","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kenta, a member of the RedSuns, challenges Takumi to a downhill race in the pouring rain. With the increasingly wet course conditions, neither driver is guaranteed victory.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-11-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5cGuCi8m2p7iDoMvNrLL2earDzE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5cGuCi8m2p7iDoMvNrLL2earDzE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"872949","seas